    "slug": "what-do-termites-look-like",
    "title": "What Do Termites Look Like? Appearance, Size and Color",
    "date": "May 8, 2026",
    "dateISO": "2026-05-08",
    "category": "Blog",
    "pestCategory": "Termites",
